  "_comment": "Prices are the supplier's cost in USD per million tokens; FORGE_MARKUP is applied on top. Token Factory models are FREE to users (pricing \"free\", owner decision 2026-11-15): Token Factory charges Forge nothing during its beta, so a request needs a balance key and is never held or charged (docs/PAYMENTS.md, Free models). They carry no token price; the 1.0 in / 4.0 out per million placeholders they had before were never from a rate card and were dropped. When the beta ends, set pricing back to paid with prices from the Token Factory rate card (their /v1/model/info returned no cost fields on 2026-11-09). Context lengths below are from that endpoint's max_input_tokens. Tinfoil prices were read from https://inference.tinfoil.sh/v1/models on 2026-11-09. Audio models (the audio list) were read from https://api.tinfoil.sh/api/config/models on 2026-11-13: whisper-large-v3-turbo requestPrice 0.01 USD and voxtral-tts requestPrice 0.002 USD per request, no token price; voices from docs.tinfoil.sh/guides/processing-audio. Web search (2026-11-14): Tinfoil's Private Web Search requestPrice 0.05 USD per request that searched, from https://api.tinfoil.sh/api/config/models (model websearch, type tool); every Tinfoil chat model listed there has toolCalling true, and docs.tinfoil.sh/guides/web-search says search is used alongside chat models. extra_input_tokens and output_factor are Forge's hold allowance for what a search adds (results in the input, several model calls), not Tinfoil figures.",
